            <title>[IGNITE-4398] Web console: incorrect authentication under IE 11 (windows 10)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4398</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;To reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
1) log in as User1&lt;br/&gt;
2) create some cluster and save&lt;br/&gt;
3) log out&lt;br/&gt;
4) log in as User2&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You will see the cluster from User1.&lt;br/&gt;
Note: IE specific only&lt;/p&gt;</description>
